            "description": "<h4>INVESTED IN TECHNOLOGY</h4><p>By investing in new equipment, we’re able to provide our customers with unmatched services, turnaround times and capabilities. Our team is always looking for new technologies to keep our shop running as efficiently as possible.</p><h4><br/>OUR TEAM IS OUR BIGGEST ASSET</h4><p>It’s not just talk when we say our team is our most valuable resource. Our technicians and engineers have been involved in designing some of the most innovative equipment in the masonry, fencing, hardscape, precast and refractory and other general construction industries, as well as hundreds of custom projects. With decades of combined experience, we’re confident there’s no job our team can’t handle.</p>",
